5:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-ink-600","children":"To provide accessible, compassionate, and high-quality healthcare to every patient who walks through our doors — with special dedication to the underserved and deserving members of our community who need care the most. At Al Sadiq Health Care Centre, we believe quality treatment should never be out of reach because of financial hardship, and we are committed to serving with dignity, honesty, and excellence at every step of the patient journey."}]
